    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control a droid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to capture a percentage of the total screen area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware!\u00a0 Enemy droids patrol the screen to prevent you from achieving your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your wits about you; for strategy, reflexes, and timing will prevail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck and stay safe!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(60) levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(3) difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(5) gameplay modes\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and a collection of enemy droids - some predictable - some erratic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807790/extras/409bcaf23cf5b1cdff03b4d025bdf1e3.avif?t=1755193300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control a droid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to capture a percentage of the total screen area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware!\u00a0 Enemy droids patrol the screen to prevent you from achieving your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your wits about you; for strategy, reflexes, and timing will prevail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck and stay safe!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(60) levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(3) difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(5) gameplay modes\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and a collection of enemy droids - some predictable - some erratic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807790/extras/409bcaf23cf5b1cdff03b4d025bdf1e3.avif?t=1755193300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
